# Frontend scope

You are working in the Qeeva Angular frontend. Follow `Qeeva-Frontend/AGENTS.md` for full rules.

Key constraints:
- Signals-first state; OnPush; lazy routes
- No direct `localStorage` — use storage abstraction services in `core/storage/`
- Financial calculations live in `core/domain/` — keep UI decoupled
- Preserve API contracts with `Qeeva-Backend/` unless explicitly asked to change them
- Run from `Qeeva-Frontend/`: `npm start` (SSR) or `ng serve` (:4200)
